kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/6a5d62e80628c655e228080f1dd74af029605849/ss_6a5d62e80628c655e228080f1dd74af029605849.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745263925","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/6a5d62e80628c655e228080f1dd74af029605849/ss_6a5d62e80628c655e228080f1dd74af029605849.600x338.jpg?t=1745263925"}],"short_description":"Dustbound is a deckbuilding survivors-like roguelite. Between waves of monsters and deadly sandstorms, take moments to upgrade your cards and shape your character\u2019s build\u2014then dive back into the fight.","steam_appid":3441420,"support_info":{"email":"nordman.games@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}